:   finish_reason (or, for parallel calls, a higher index appearing). Parse and validate only at finish.
: expected ModelEvents: ToolCallDelta(id=call_FIXTUREa1b2c3, name=get_weather) xN,
:   ToolCallReady(call_FIXTUREa1b2c3, get_weather, {"location":"San Francisco, CA","unit":"fahrenheit"}),
:   Usage(input=82, output=18), Completed(stop=tool_calls)

